handled but it would break down the only major platform difference NH
currently suffers from, which is a good thing.I would then be able to
play the same game using the same interface on my (hypothetical) apple
mac laptop, headless linux box, windows desktop, and even some kind of
pocket PC. That would be very cool, even if its a feature I personally
wouldnt use.

