This is what I love about an Open Source game like NH.The users can
suggest new features which may get implemented into the next version
(if the idea is workable and good).
The development is ongoing and the game is always getting better,
unlike commercial games which get developed on a once off basis and
_might_ get an expansion (depending on the company and the products
market success).


